    "detailed_description": "In this Hidden-Object Puzzle Adventure:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour bestseller about the Order of evil witches has grabbed the attention of a huge publisher. They're ready to cut you a check, but they want to get the draft of your next horror novel as soon as possible. You decide to write about Bloody Mary. What a luck! Pennsylvania Museum has presented a unique exhibit \u2013 the mirror of Mary herself. You go there to do research, but the legend turns out to be more than fiction. Try to survive the encounter with a vengeful ghost by solving puzzles and looking for objects hidden in both human and ghostly worlds!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis Collector's Edition includes: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nInvestigate the disappearance of a young woman and meet mysterious La Llorona in the Bonus Chapter!<br />\r\nReplay your favorite HOPs and mini-games!<br />\r\nFind more collectibles and morphing objects!<br />\r\nGet downloadable music and wallpapers!",
